            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "امی نے ڈاکٹر کو گھر بلوایا۔ ammī ne ḍākṭar ko ghar bulvāyā. Mum had the doctor called to the house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے حکیم کو بلوایا, us ne hakīm ko bulvāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بلوانا (bulvānā) is built on بلانا, \"to call\", which CDIAL lists under bōll, \"speak\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 9321): the form for having someone else do the calling."
            }
          ]
        },
